            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="748.3864" YPOS="2081.88935384615" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="192155744" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="255.896" HEIGHT="118.63064615385" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="1" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="0" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L255.896 0 L255.896 118.631 L0 118.631 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L255.896 0 L255.896 118.63 L0 118.63 L0 0 Z" gXpos="748.3864" gYpos="2081.88615384615" gWidth="282.55" gHeight="45.4146798798563" ALIGN="1" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle ALIGN="1" LINESP="28" FONT="Special Elite Regular" FONTSIZE="33" SCALEH="90" KERN="-10"/>
                <ITEXT SCALEH="90" KERN="-10" CH="Why we shouldn't "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT SCALEH="90" KERN="-10" CH="tear down the Confederate statue "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT SCALEH="90" KERN="-10" CH="to be erected in 2027"/>
                <trail/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="750.6904" YPOS="2204.5072" OwnPage="-1" ItemID="192167072" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="255.1451" HEIGHT="240.2368" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="2" COLGAP="7.2" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L255.145 0 L255.145 240.237 L0 240.237 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L255.145 0 L255.145 240.237 L0 240.237 L0 0 Z" gXpos="594.0424" gYpos="1325.3798" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle LINESP="10" FONT="Bell MT Regular" FONTSIZE="9"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Bold" CH="Rock Buddy E. Lee"/>
                <para ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Bell MT Italic" CH="The democrats were the real racists"/>
                <para ALIGN="1" LINESP="10"/>
                <para ALIGN="0" LINESP="10"/>
                <ITEXT CH="    There’s been a lot of talk about getting rid of the statue of Nathaniel Bedford Forest in a year. Readmeitor, I am not afraid to say that I find this disconcerting. How will we be able to erase this part of our history? Listen, I won’t deny that the KKK is problematic, but when all is said and done, we can’t erase our actions in the future. How can you judge a man without ever meeting him? He had a family, he had kids. While his beliefs may not agree with yours, this was a man who cared. "/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    There are statues of Hatsune Miku, but we can’t accept the statue of one American man. He had the name Forest. We have more deforestation than ever. Why can't we accept a forest within a field of woke? A statue doesn’t also necessarily mean we’re worshipping or idolizing a man, I own several statues of various German leaders in my house and they’re purely for historical reasons."/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="    Why are we getting mad over a man who attacked a fort called Fort Pillow? It’s a pillow. What, next are we going to attack Woodrow Wilson for making the Teddy Bear? We don’t have many people to idolize from Tennessee anyways. Who are we going to build statues of if not the wizard of the saddle? Jerry “Gordo” Blevins? Charles Burson?? Roscoe Tanner??? Have you gone mad Pennsyltuckey??!"/>
                <para/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="113.1242" YPOS="2921.625" OwnPage="3" ItemID="187454816" PTYPE="2" WIDTH="289.125" HEIGHT="372.875" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="0.225984848484848" LOCALSCY="0.225984848484848" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="0" RATIO="1" Pagenumber="0" PFILE="5.9 Images/LDOC Picnic.png" IRENDER="0" EMBEDDED="0" path="M0 0 L289.125 0 L289.125 372.875 L0 372.875 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L289.125 0 L289.125 372.875 L0 372.875 L0 0 Z" gXpos="113.1242" gYpos="2921.625" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1"/>
